    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Stack</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Simulation</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/asteroid-collision/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 735</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Asteroid Collision</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Only a right-mover on the left meeting a left-mover on the right can collide, and it always happens at the boundary between the survivors and the newcomer. Keep the survivors on a stack; each newcomer pops the smaller right-movers it destroys. Every asteroid is pushed and popped at most once: O(n) time, O(n) space.</p>\n"
  },
